faYqTi64e0pDmPSa8c1yoMOv9JyJmRrp9lL6fDG8dNMwQCMltfQQ89atA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyLu6JPJd6bqs9fPLGpdbKSSjlgpzSqlbobllGxZ4GWqw&oe=69B6C2D3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car War Vr: RC Stunt Game", "keywords": ["driving", "race", "mini", "drift", "fight"], "long_description": "Car War VR: RC Stunt Game is an action-packed VR racing and combat game that puts you in control of high-powered remote control cars armed to the teeth. Designed exclusively for virtual reality, this single-player experience combines arcade-style racing, vehicle combat, and extreme stunt driving into one adrenaline-fueled package.\nStrap into the cockpit view of your RC war machine and enter explosive arenas filled with jumps, ramps, and AI enemies. Use skill, speed, and strategy to perform jaw-dropping stunts, avoid deadly traps, and blast opponents with powerful weapons like rockets, lasers, and EMPs.\nCustomize your car with a variety of upgrades\u2014boosters, armor, wheels, and weapons\u2014to suit your combat style. Explore unique environments, from backyard battlegrounds to sci-fi stunt zones, each crafted for fast-paced, chaotic fun.\nKey Features:\nImmersive VR racing combat with intuitive controls\n\n\nHigh-speed, physics-driven RC stunt action\n\n\n- Customizable cars with unlockable weapons and gadgets\n- Challenging single-player missions and smart AI opponents\n- Explosive visuals with slow-motion effects and dynamic crashes\n\nExperience the thrill of car battles in VR like never before. Car War VR: RC Stunt Game is the ultimate test of your reflexes, creativity, and combat driving skills.", "short_description": "Race, drift, and stunt in this high-speed RC car VR experience! Build custom tracks, upgrade your ride, and compete solo in action-packed challenges. Designed for Meta Quest, this immersive racing game brings remote control fun to life with realistic physics and endless creativity."}]},